f Parents Community Apply Visit Give Close Home Careers Fast Facts about Roanoke Alumni Fast Facts About Roanoke Alumni 18,000+ graduates living in all 50 states and across the world in almost 50 different countries 93% of alumni are satisfied or very satisfied with their education. 96% say professors are genuinely interested in students. 90% of alumni report that their professors influenced their personal growth. More than 1,000 alumni serve as Maroon Mentors, helping current students with career preparation questions. Grad School 90% of graduates have obtained jobs or been accepted to graduate school within six months of graduating from Roanoke 1 in 5 Out out of five Roanoke students go to graduate school immediately after graduation. 40% of alumni over their lifetimes will attain advanced degrees. 221 College Lane, Salem, Virginia 24153 540-375-2500 (Main Telephone Number) Contact Us Maps & Parking Roanoke on Social © 2026 Roanoke College. All rights reserved. Roanoke College, Elderscholar, The Management Institute, Roanoke Review, Roanoke Maroons and associated logos are trademarks of Roanoke College. Policies Careers at Roanoke College Operating Status Legal Notices"
