Apply Visit Give Close Home Careers Campus Jobs Campus Jobs Work. Learn. Earn. It's that easy. Roanoke offers 500+ employment opportunities for students, with jobs available in nearly every part of campus. Get a head start on building valuable professional skills and gaining real-world experience that will boost your resume. Programs and advisors will help you balance your campus job with your class schedule and extracurricular commitments. Supervisors are dedicated to mentoring students and giving them meaningful opportunities to grow, lead and excel. Some jobs may qualify for internship credit or federal work-study. Guidance can be sought from your advisor (internship credits) or PLACE and Financial Aid (work-study). How do I get started? Log onto Handshake to search the job openings available for current students. Search Jobs Countless Opportunities Work with a professor. Plan campus events. Help a nonprofit. Troubleshoot IT woes. Roanoke College offers a broad range of jobs to fit your interests and goals. Clicking the buttons in this list will open the gallery\r\n                                    lightbox. Click to open the gallery lightbox. Experience that matters \"Supervisors trusted me to have responsibility for certain things and that has allowed me to practice professionalism that I have been able to pull from in professional interviews.\" Kristi Rolf '23, psychology major, research assistant, peer mentor Resources Handshake Work-Study Student Employment Handbook Human Resources Career Services PLACE CliftonStrengths Student Employment Tip Sheet 221 College Lane, Salem, Virginia 24153 540-375-2500 (Main Telephone Number) Contact Us Maps & Parking Roanoke on Social © 2026 Roanoke College. All rights reserved. Roanoke College, Elderscholar, The Management Institute, Roanoke Review, Roanoke Maroons and associated logos are trademarks of Roanoke College. Policies Careers at Roanoke College Operating Status Legal Notices"
